          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_SUMMARY_GENERATOR",
          "id": "1767250215381",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767250215382_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You generate EXACTLY ONE professional summary sentence.\n\nUser Input:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nSummary Input (authoritative):\n {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_CODE_PARSE_RESULT.$output.result}} \n\nRules:\n- Use ONLY information from Summary Input\n- Mention offer status ONLY if provided\n- Supplier wording:\n  - If exactly one supplier exists, say: \"supplier <supplier name>\"\n  - If more than one supplier exists, say: \"multiple suppliers\"\n  - If no supplier exists, do not mention supplier\n- Business unit wording:\n  - If exactly one business unit exists, say: \"business unit <business unit name>\"\n  - If more than one business unit exists, say: \"multiple business units\"\n  - If no business unit exists, do not mention business unit\n- If totalInstallments > 10, append:\n  \"Only 10 installments are shown; remaining will be displayed after applying further filters.\"\n- Do NOT invent data\n- Do NOT return JSON\n- Do NOT add explanations\n- Output EXACTLY ONE sentence\n`\n\n---\n\n## EXPECTED BEHAVIOR (EXAMPLES)\n\n### Case 1: Single Supplier + Single Business Unit\n\n**Input**\n\n{\n  \"suppliers\": [\"GE Capital\"],\n  \"businessUnits\": [\"US Finance\"],\n  \"offerStatuses\": [\"draft\"],\n  \"totalInstallments\": 5\n}\n\n\n**Output**\n\nThe following are the installments included in the draft offer for supplier GE Capital and business unit US Finance.\n\n\n---\n\n### Case 2: Multiple Suppliers + Multiple Business Units\n\n**Input**\n\n\n{\n  \"suppliers\": [\"GE Capital\", \"Siemens\"],\n  \"businessUnits\": [\"US Finance\", \"EU Ops\"],\n  \"offerStatuses\": [],\n  \"totalInstallments\": 18\n}\n\n\n**Output**\n\nThe following are the installments included in the offer for multiple suppliers and multiple business units. Only 10 installments are shown; remaining will be displayed after applying further filters.\n\n\n---\n\n### Case 3: Single Supplier Only\n\n**Input**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"suppliers\": [\"GE Capital\"],\n  \"businessUnits\": [],\n  \"offerStatuses\": [\"communicated\"],\n  \"totalInstallments\": 12\n}\n```\n\n**Output**\n\nThe following are the installments included in the communicated offer for supplier GE Capital. Only 10 installments are shown; remaining will be displayed after applying further filters."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1765715409538",
            "name": "Generate Output",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "// Inputs from previous nodes\nconst installments =\n  $context.$nodes.FIN_AP_CODE_PARSE_RESULT.$output.result.installments || [];\nconst summaryText =\n  $context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_SUMMARY_GENERATOR.$output;\n\n// Declare final output variable\nlet finalOutput;\n\n// No installments case (STRICT)\nif (installments.length === 0) {\n  finalOutput = [\n    {\n      type: \"text\",\n      sequence: 1,\n      content: [\"No installments were found for the selected offer(s).\"]\n    },\n    {\n      type: \"table\",\n      sequence: 2,\n      heading: \"Installment Details\",\n      content: []\n    }\n  ];\n} else {\n  // Build table rows (max 10, strict fields)\n  const tableContent = installments.slice(0, 10).map(i => {\n    let formattedDueDate = i.dueDate;\n\n    // Convert DD-MM-YYYY → YYYY-MM-DD\n    if (i.dueDate && typeof i.dueDate === \"string\") {\n      const parts = i.dueDate.split(\"-\");\n      if (parts.length === 3) {\n        const [day, month, year] = parts;\n        formattedDueDate = `${year}-${month.padStart(2, \"0\")}-${day.padStart(2, \"0\")}`;\n      }\n    }\n\n    return {\n      invoiceNumber: i.invoiceNumber,\n      installmentNumber: i.installmentNumber,\n      dueDate: formattedDueDate,\n      supplierSiteName: i.supplierSiteName,\n      businessUnitName: i.businessUnitName,\n      unpaidAmount: i.unpaidAmount,\n      currencyCode: i.currencyCode\n    };\n  });\n\n  finalOutput = [\n    {\n      type: \"text\",\n      sequence: 1,\n      content: [summaryText]\n    },\n    {\n      type: \"table\",\n      sequence: 2,\n      heading: \"Installment Details\",\n      content: tableContent,\n      columnOrder: [\n        \"invoiceNumber\",\n        \"installmentNumber\",\n        \"dueDate\",\n        \"supplierSiteName\",\n        \"businessUnitName\",\n        \"unpaidAmount\",\n        \"currencyCode\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ];\n}\n\n// Single return at the end\nreturn finalOutput;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1768184283351"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5015,
            "y": 6760
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_CODE_GENERATE_OUTPUT",
          "id": "1767250298751",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.25
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Format Installment Result"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5480,
            "y": 6316
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_INSTALLMENT_RESULT_FORMAT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1767250162813",
          "id": "1765715409538",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765715409539_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an **Offer Installments Response Formatter**.\n\nYou will be provided with:\n\n* Installment data retrieved from a backend tool\n\n  `{{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_BO_OFFER_INSTALLMENT.$output}}`\n\n* Optional contextual metadata (supplier, offer status)\n\nYour responsibility is to **format the response only**.\n\nYou must **not**:\n\n* Infer intent\n* Apply filters\n* Invoke tools\n* Ask follow-up questions\n* Add recommendations or suggestions\n\n---\n\n### Output Contract (Strict)\n\nReturn a **JSON array** using the structure defined below.\nDo not return prose, markdown, or explanations outside this array.\n\n---\n\n### Output Blocks\n\n#### 1. Text Block (Always Required)\n\n* `type`: `\"text\"`\n* `sequence`: `1`\n* `content`: array of one or more strings\n\n**Rules:**\n\n* Provide a concise summary sentence\n* Mention **offer status** (draft, communicated, approved, etc.) **only if available in the data**\n* Mention **supplier name** if available\n* If more than 10 installments exist, append:\n\n  > “Only 10 installments are shown; remaining will be displayed after applying further filters.”\n\n**Examples:**\n\n* “The following are the installments included in the draft offer for GE Capital.”\n* “The following are the installments included in the communicated offer for GE Capital.”\n* “The following are the installments included for GE Capital.”\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Table Block (Conditionally Required)\n\nInclude this block **only when at least one installment exists**.\n\n* `type`: `\"table\"`\n* `sequence`: `2`\n* `heading`: `\"Installment Details\"`\n* `content`: array of objects\n\n**Rules:**\n\n* Display **no more than 10 rows**\n* Preserve the original ordering from the backend response\n* Show **only the fields listed below**\n* Do not compute, enrich, or derive values\n\n**Field Mapping (Strict):**\n\n| Backend Field       | Output Field        |\n| ------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `invoiceId`         | `invoiceId`         |\n| `installmentNumber` | `installmentNumber` |\n| `dueDate`           | `dueDate`           |\n| `supplierSiteName`  | `supplierSiteName`  |\n| `businessUnitName`  | `businessUnitName`  |\n| `unpaidAmount`      | `unpaidAmount`      |\n\nNo additional columns are permitted.\n\n---\n\n### Error & Edge Case Handling\n\n#### No Installments Found\n\nReturn **only** the following:\n\n* A single `text` block with:\n\n  > “No installments were found for the selected offer(s).”\n\n**Do not include a table block or any other blocks.**\n\n---\n\n### Tone & Constraints\n\n* Professional, concise, and neutral\n* Do not expand beyond retrieved data\n* Do not display more than **10 installments**\n* Output must be **valid JSON only**\n\n---\n\n### Final Output Shape (Reference)\n\n#### When installments exist\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\"...\"],\n    \"sequence\": 1\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"table\",\n    \"heading\": \"Installment Details\",\n    \"content\": [],\n    \"sequence\": 2\n  }\n]\n```\n\n#### When no installments exist\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\"No installments were found for the selected offer(s).\"],\n    \"sequence\": 1\n  }\n]\n```"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
